            "review_title": "Review at Deku Salad",
            "review_text": "Hạnh Phan\n6 contributions\n0\nGreat salad in Hochiminh city\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nIt’s so happy that I can find a good salad as Deku Salad in Hochiminh city. Their ingredients are fresh and prepared in day with a lot of topping and sauce to customize as I want. The bowl is really big in comparison with the price and quality.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 2, 2020",
