            "review_title": "Review at Deku Salad",
            "review_text": "Xpatxplorer\nNew Delhi, India811 contributions\n0\nOrganic salad from farm to table!\nMay 2019 • Friends\nDeku Salad Bar- An organic salad bar that source its vegetables directly from farmers in Dalat. It has a limited menu of 5 set salads but you can creat your own salads choosing from 6 different bases, 4 proteins, 6 dressings and many toppings. It’s very small with only one table seating 6 at the moment. It is difficult to stumble upon located in a little alley just behind my kingdom. A must go for salad lovers with great tasting salad at a very affordable price with generous portions. Do take cash as they do not accept credit cards. They do delivery as well.\nRead more\nWritten May 7, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
