            "review_title": "Review at Deku Salad",
            "review_text": "Peter Kristoffer\n2 contributions\n0\nGenuinely healthy and nutritious salads\nAug 2018 • Friends\nTried Deku Salad for the first time using their home delivery service. We ordered three different salads: the Protein Salad, the Dekunamese Salad, and the Nicoise Salad.\n\nDeku Salad would fall into the category of healthy and high quality salads. It tries to maintain a fresh taste while trying to exclude a lot of high calorie and sugar-rich dressings, unlike your normal \"healthy choice\" of salad that is still packed with some 1,000 calories. \n\nMy review score for Deku Salad is relatively high due to the great first experience when it comes to speed of delivery, the freshness of ingredients and taste, and the feeling of having a genuinely healthy meal. I also find the prices reasonable, as the portions were large while also having free delivery to District 1 where I live.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 26, 2018",
